  "coverage_limit": "unsafe-libyaml's documented libyaml document API (yaml_parser_initialize, yaml_parser_set_input_string, yaml_parser_load, yaml_document_get_root_node/get_node) on local UTF-8 bytes, with exactly one document required. unsafe-libyaml is a c2rust translation of libyaml and the same crate the selected serde_yaml path drives, so this path is in the libyaml family. libyaml's loader points aliases at the anchored node and reports scalar style but does not resolve plain scalars: the harness types plain scalars with the YAML 1.2 core-schema patterns (null, bool, int, float, otherwise str), as the C libyaml harness does. Mapping keys must be scalars. The schema-neutral controls do not test tags, merge keys, multi-document streams or YAML 1.1-only scalars."
